{"text": "This is the clipping picture from D2a, with the upper edge moved from 1.2 to 1.28. Why bother? Take a token that the old policy gave one percent. With a symmetric clip it can only rise to 1.2 percent in one step, while a token at ninety percent is not held back at all. Rare tokens are where new ideas start, and DAPO found that the symmetric clip makes the policy collapse onto its most common phrasings. Raising only the upper edge gives the rare tokens a little more room.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 33.75, "words": [[0.1, 0.263, "This"], [0.263, 0.363, "is"], [0.362, 0.45, "the"], [0.45, 0.75, "clipping"], [0.75, 1.137, "picture"], [1.15, 1.425, "from"], [1.438, 2.388, "D2a"], [2.788, 2.913, "with"], [2.913, 3.025, "the"], [3.038, 3.337, "upper"], [3.337, 3.6, "edge"], [3.6, 3.925, "moved"], [3.925, 4.087, "from"], [4.088, 4.988, "1.2"], [5.15, 5.3, "to"], [5.312, 6.412, "1.28"], [6.825, 7.013, "Why"], [7.025, 7.475, "bother"], [7.875, 8.012, "Take"], [8.012, 8.062, "a"], [8.075, 8.5, "token"], [8.512, 8.612, "that"], [8.613, 8.7, "the"], [8.812, 9.037, "old"], [9.037, 9.675, "policy"], [10.025, 10.35, "gave"], [10.363, 10.688, "one"], [10.688, 11.275, "percent"], [11.675, 11.763, "With"], [11.762, 11.812, "a"], [11.825, 12.287, "symmetric"], [12.287, 12.625, "clip"], [13.062, 13.113, "it"], [13.113, 13.225, "can"], [13.225, 13.512, "only"], [13.512, 14.025, "rise"], [14.088, 14.225, "to"], [14.225, 15.612, "1.2 percent"], [15.625, 15.738, "in"], [15.75, 16.012, "one"], [16.025, 16.475, "step"], [16.9, 17.075, "while"], [17.087, 17.15, "a"], [17.163, 17.525, "token"], [17.525, 17.587, "at"], [17.587, 17.95, "ninety"], [17.95, 18.475, "percent"], [18.738, 18.838, "is"], [18.85, 19.188, "not"], [19.188, 19.413, "held"], [19.425, 19.675, "back"], [19.675, 19.738, "at"], [19.75, 20.025, "all"], [20.425, 20.675, "Rare"], [20.688, 21.175, "tokens"], [21.188, 21.375, "are"], [21.387, 21.562, "where"], [21.562, 21.85, "new